## Acceptance boundary

The duplicate statistics log fan-out and cross-series sampling discrepancy are
closed. Broad P18-V01 bidirectional API/settings/input/error/control-flow and
reverse-export reconciliation remains PARTIAL. Native Windows execution and
current-revision remote CI remain open. No plan was edited, no push or remote
CI was run, and the four user-owned Phase 19 paths remain untouched and
unstaged.
